<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5343] Zepplin Interface becomes unresponsive</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5343</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;From time to time the Zeppelin Interface stops working nearly completely.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The upper task bar remains and will still load, but the main interface just shows a blank white page - please see attached screenshot&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We were unable to find any hints in the logs so far&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The only way to get Zeppelin working again is to restart the entire instance&lt;/p&gt;</description>
